	(text "IGNITION CHANNELS 1-8 (low-side switches)\nChannel n: J40n terminal (Pin 2 = Ignition Rail, Pin 1 = igniter return)\nQ40n AO3400A N-FET pulls the igniter to GND when 'Channel n' is high\nR40n 10k gate pull-down keeps the channel OFF while the driver is undriven\nDrain node = 'Continuity Sense n' -> divider + mux (Continuity Reading)\nAn igniter only fires if the Ignition Rail is ON (Q301) AND Q40n is ON"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
